+ do ai-image-unlock ?! AIError
    - access AIAccess?

. needed = access
=? if !needed || needed.is-granted
?! AIError(AIErrorKind.cancellation, "No image was made, because the user did not provide an ${needed.name} API key.")
    if !needed.ask("Generating images needs an ${needed.name} API key.", ai-image-key-patience)

