    - levels [AIImageLevel]

Map'String'JSON
    • type "string"
    • enum names
    • description "How much care, time, and cost go into the images, from the cheapest to the best. default follows the user's setting; use another value only when the user asks for a different quality."

.. names = List'JSON(each in [ai-image-default] ++ List'String(each.name in levels))

