━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ ¶ ai-full-size-prompt
    - prompt String
    - direction String?
    - has-sources Bool

The first image is a small, rough draft. Redraw it as a finished, full-size image with full detail, keeping its subject, composition, colors, and style.$sources

The draft was made from this prompt:
$prompt$note

════════════════════
.. sources = if has-sources then " The other images are the images the draft was made from." else ""
.. note = if direction then "\n\nThis variation: $direction" else ""

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ do ai-draft-origin AIDraftOrigin?
    - messages [AIMessage]
    - id String

. calls = Map'String'AIToolCallPart()
for message in messages
    for part in message.parts
        if | call AIToolCallPart = part
            calls[call.call-id] = call
        else if | result AIToolResultPart = part
            . index = ai-draft-index(result.output, id)
            . call = calls[result.call-id]
            if index != null && call
                = ai-draft-call-origin(call, index, result.output)
= null

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ ¶ ai-variations-prompt
    - sheet AISheet
    - prompt String
    - directions [String]
    - has-sources Bool
    - is-clear Bool

The first image is a blank sheet with a $grid of cells outlined by light blue guides. Draw a separate picture inside each of the $count outlined cells, $fill, so the sheet holds $count variations of this:

$prompt
$sources$cells
Make each variation clearly different from the others. Keep the light blue guides where they are, $between, and draw nothing outside the cells. Draw no text, labels, or numbers unless a picture itself calls for them.

════════════════════
.. grid = sheet.grid-name
.. count = sheet.count
.. fill = if is-clear then "each centered in its cell with a clear margin inside the guides, on a fully transparent background" else "filling each cell edge to edge"
.. between = if is-clear then "leave everything around the pictures fully transparent, with no white or tinted fill, haze, glow, or shadow behind them" else "keep the space between the cells plain white"
.. sources = if has-sources then "\nThe other images are the images to work from.\n" else ""
.. cells = if directions then "\nHow each cell differs:\n${"\n".join(ai-variation-line(sheet, directions, each) in 0 .. < min(directions.length, sheet.count))}\n" else ""

